Boston Food Finder

Boston Food Finder is a responsive restaurant discovery web application that lets users search for restaurants by cuisine, location, search radius in miles, and number of results.

The project uses a FastAPI backend with the Geoapify API and a responsive HTML/CSS/JavaScript frontend.

Features

Users can:

Search restaurants by cuisine

Search by city or location

Choose a search radius in miles

Choose the maximum number of restaurant results

View restaurant names and addresses


